BOSS Scorchion Engage Reset
    Events
        Time - Every 2.00 seconds of game time
    Conditions
    Actions
        -------- Assume all units are out of combat initially --------
        Set VariableSet DarkShamansInCombat = False
        Unit Group - Pick every unit in BossScorchionDarkShamans and do (Actions)
            Loop - Actions
                Set VariableSet CV = (Custom value of (Picked unit))
                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                    If - Conditions
                        GCSM_UnitInCombat[CV] Equal to True
                    Then - Actions
                        -------- If any unit is in combat, set TempBoolean to False --------
                        Set VariableSet DarkShamansInCombat = True
                    Else - Actions
        -------- This part runs AFTER checking all units --------
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                DarkShamansInCombat Equal to False
                BossScorchionDarkShamansR_ON Equal to False
            Then - Actions
                -------- If ALL units are out of combat, start the timer --------
                Countdown Timer - Start BossScorchionDarkShamansRTimer as a One-shot timer that will expire in 30.00 seconds
                Game - Display to (All players) the text: Starting timer to r...
                Set VariableSet BossScorchionDarkShamansR_ON = True
            Else - Actions
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                DarkShamansInCombat Equal to True
            Then - Actions
                -------- If even ONE unit is still in combat, pause the timer --------
                Countdown Timer - Pause BossScorchionDarkShamansRTimer
                Game - Display to (All players) the text: Some unit still in ...
                Set VariableSet BossScorchionDarkShamansR_ON = False
            Else - Actions
